## 6. LISTING YOUR MESS

### 6.1 Creating Your Listing
You can create a listing by providing:
- Mess name, address, and location
- Operating hours and meal timings
- Photos of your mess establishment
- Thalis and dish offerings
- Pricing information
- Contact details (displayed or hidden per your choice)

### 6.2 Content Standards
All content you provide must:
- Be accurate, truthful, and not misleading
- Represent your actual mess establishment and offerings
- Use real photos of your mess (no stock photos)
- Comply with applicable laws and regulations
- Not infringe on any third-party rights
- Not contain offensive, inappropriate, or illegal content
- Be in English, Hindi, or other languages supported by the platform

### 6.3 Prohibited Content
You may NOT include:
- False or misleading information
